# Deliberate exceptions to scripts/workflow-listeners.mjs (#2893). One `<file> <rule>` per line.
# Each needs a reason; the default answer to a new line here is "fold it into the owner file".

# Project-board / PR status mirrors (#2891): they must see EVERY close to move a card to Done,
# and do no other work. Folding them in would couple the board to the cleanup jobs' failures.
status.yml issues-closed
status.yml pr-closed
